<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Tuesday updated figures of livestock exports to Mexico from the state of Texas to June 9.</p>
<p>Species		   Wk-To-Date   Yr-Date   Last Year</p>
<p>1) Beef Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		445	    52,960     37,769</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   7	     1,256	  749</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	43	     2,485	1,016</p>
<p>2) Hogs</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		  0		 410     31,831</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	  13		 366	  140</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     4,679	  846</p>
<p>3) Dairy Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Breeding Males	   0		 144	   33</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Females	36	    12,911	6,094</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
<p>E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
